# isoloom targets
✗ cloud-vm (no cloud can run it (aws: machine `box`: Isoloom generates no arm64 VM on AWS; azure: machine `box`: Isoloom generates no arm64 VM on Azure; gcp: machine `box`: Isoloom generates no arm64 VM on Google Cloud; digitalocean: machine `box`: DigitalOcean has no arm64 droplets; linode: machine `box`: Linode has no arm64 plans; oci: machine `box`: Isoloom generates no arm64 VM on Oracle Cloud))

# isoloom generate --target cloud-vm (exit 1)
· cloud-vm: no cloud can run it (aws: machine `box`: Isoloom generates no arm64 VM on AWS; azure: machine `box`: Isoloom generates no arm64 VM on Azure; gcp: machine `box`: Isoloom generates no arm64 VM on Google Cloud; digitalocean: machine `box`: DigitalOcean has no arm64 droplets; linode: machine `box`: Linode has no arm64 plans; oci: machine `box`: Isoloom generates no arm64 VM on Oracle Cloud)
